OL,3,A'I'm fed up of swiping': The singles
OL,4,Achoosing dating events over apps
OL,5,
OL,6,FChecking in at a dating event in a bar
OL,7,Fin Guildford, Olivia Miller-Davis is
OL,8,Funderstandably apprehensive.
OL,10,FEven bringing a friend with her doesn't
OL,11,Fremove the awkwardness at the start of
OL,12,Fthe night.
OL,14,F"It's always nerve-wracking when you're
OL,15,Fmeeting new people," the 28-year-old
OL,16,Fadmits before downloading an app that
OL,17,Fwill match her to other daters based on
OL,18,Ftheir star signs.
