OL,4,Achoosing dating events over apps
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is speed dating 2026-style and
OL,7,FOlivia, like many people we speak to,
OL,8,Fis here because she's fed up of
OL,9,F"endlessly swiping" or as some describe
OL,10,Fit "app fatigue".
